# corpus/mac/mac_bs_type_telex_english_21 — BackspaceType EN chứa tone-key được restore (master) (P2-5 §2)
:config method=telex diacritic_style=new
:caps field_detect
:app com.apple.finder field=editbox

:config method=telex diacritic_style=new english_words=master
:type "master"
:expect "matẻ"
:key Space
:expect "master "
